2. Coding ko parts mein divide karenge
Part	Work
Part 0	Approved file/folder scaffold
Part 1	Package, dependencies, TypeScript configuration, build
Part 2	Fastify app, startup, configuration validation
Part 3	Error handling, health/readiness, graceful shutdown
Part 4	API registration, contracts, OpenAPI foundation
Part 5	Existing CORE/AI integration boundaries
Part 6	Complete B1 regression and CI verification

Har part mein main ek saath poore related files ka complete code dunga. Ek-ek chhoti file ke liye baar-baar nahi rokunga.
3. Har part ke baad audit
Part completion checklist
- [ ] Exact files aur folders verify
- [ ] Duplicate file/module/logic check
- [ ] Imports aur dependency check
- [ ] TypeScript strict build
- [ ] ESLint aur focused tests
- [ ] Existing CORE/AI regression, jahan relevant ho
- [ ] Security aur tenant-boundary checks
- [ ] PowerShell audit output review
- [ ] GitHub source readback aur Actions verification
- [ ] Gaps fix karke phir next part

PowerShell audit tumhare machine par execute hoga; tum output share karoge, main uska analysis karunga aur GitHub source aur CI se independently cross-check bhi karunga.
4. Ek important rule
Existing state.json mein abhi APP-001-T01 current hai. Isliye structure ko yahan finalize karna aur implementation ki exact batches taiyar karna possible hai, lekin repository mein backend files create/save karne se pehle formal execution authorization zaroori hai. Main state bypass nahi karunga.

Mera final recommendation: structure-first, code-part-by-part, audit-after-every-part. Na parallel backend, na duplicate engines, na adhura code. Isi tarah HOMIO backend ko systematically build karenge.
